<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia IJM 1996 net up 16 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia IJM 1996 net up 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  74.51   vs	  64.34</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	 24.4    vs	  21.4</p>
<p>    Turnover		 1,113.95   vs	 947.34</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   116.48   vs	  97.42</p>
<p>    Minorities	  less   6.83   vs  less   6.47</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	   14.92   vs	   0.44</p>
<p>    Dividend  (pct)	    8.0    vs	   8.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is IJM Corp Bhd. It is involved in investment holding, civil and building construction, and property development.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
